I filed a supplemental exhibit with the Attorney General today in my public=
 records petition against Oregon State Police, PR27478. It is attached, alo=
ng with the underlying document.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
