, 0, 0);">
On July 23, 2026, the District Ranger for the Central Coast Ranger District=
, Siuslaw National Forest, wrote to me regarding the entry in the Oregon St=
ate Police dispatch record for March 24, 2026 reading &quot;FOR THE FOREST =
SERVICE.&quot; Her email states that the Forest
 Service did not initiate the interview, and that its involvement was limit=
ed to providing access to a secured facility.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0=
